13. What is the difference between swtiching tabs with context vs page?

page.waitForEvent('popup'):

Waits for a new tab that was opened by that specific page	
More specific	
Best when the current page triggers the tab	
--------------------------------
context.waitForEvent('page'):

Waits for any new page/tab in the browser context
More general
Useful when you don't know which page creates the tab